Third-party content
-------------------

seed/fibo-core.ttl contains a small curated subset of class definitions from
the Financial Industry Business Ontology (FIBO), Copyright the EDM Council,
Inc., licensed under the MIT License (https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/).
The subset preserves the original spec.edmcouncil.org IRIs; the keyword
annotations (skos:altLabel matcher terms) are additions by this project.

The IBM Plex typeface family is used under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

